{
  "_schema": "ucl-tavern-paths/v1",
  "_doc": [
    "Path Override Config for awakening.py (Phase 1).",
    "預設每專案各自 AgentCommands/* state. 本 config 可指向外部共享路徑, 實現多專案 agent 在同 tavern 共寫.",
    "",
    "Field 規則:",
    "- empty / missing → fallback 走 <REPO_ROOT>/<default subpath>",
